    "Id": "vehicledef_APC_HeavyHover_Scout",
    "Name": "Heavy Hover APC (Scout)",
    "Details": "The Scout Tank variant was introduced during the torrent fighting of the Jihad. The vehicle's original weaponry & infantry capacities are completely removed for its new role. The vehicle is fitted with a front mounted Class 5 Light Autocannon with 40 rounds of ammunition. The crew is given additional protection in the form of a slight increase in armor and from an ammunition explosion with CASE added to the vehicle's ammunition bay.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar or Martian biomes due to using an ICE.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       110     10\n<b>Left</b>          65     10\n<b>Right</b>        65     10\n<b>Rear</b>         40     10\n\n<b>Total</b>      280     40</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Rugged</color>",
    "Icon": "Gladius"
  },
